column3:
@primefixyz - Loss ~$33.4K (2026-09-16)
Network: HyperEVM
Type: Oracle Manipulation

@Liquid_BTC 因 Elements 共识/资产验证漏洞被攻击，攻击者利用漏洞生成约 4,000 枚无真实 BTC 抵押的 L-BTC，再通过 SideSwap 的正常 peg-out 服务，将其中 3,996.01834922 BTC 从 Liquid Federation 的比特币储备钱包兑出。

更新：攻击者退还3400 BTC，仍保留598.49 BTC（15%），退款交易：
https://mempool.space/tx/a6d697a25266ce3c78774fd1d75f896b7af522ada209b0f6228ea497bc49a46d

an ongoing exploit targeting
@StakeDAOHQ
 on Arbitrum.

Our system has detected a malicious transaction targeting a 
@SuperRare staking contract.
The attacker’s address, funded via 
@TornadoCash approximately 186 days ago, executed the exploit and gained 731K worth of $RARE.

Our system has detected a suspicious attack involving a contract #BankrollNetworkLife 
@Bankroll_Status
 on #ETH, resulting in an approximately loss of $113.3K,It appears that the well-known frontrunner c0ffeebabe.eth frontran the original attack transaction.

@GMX_IO 被攻击，损失超4200万美元。
攻击者地址:0xd4266f8f82f7405429ee18559e548979d49160f3
被攻击合约：0x489ee077994b6658eafa855c308275ead8097c4a

Our system has detected a suspicious attack involving #Peapods Finance 
@PeapodsFinance
 on #ETH, resulting in an approximately loss of $200K.

Multiple suspicious attacks involving #MPRO Lab 
@metaproapp
 on #BASE, resulting in an approximately loss of $26.2K.

由于 
@TradeOnOrion
 已升级了他们的易受攻击合约，我们现在可以提供对此漏洞的详细解释。根本原因是未正确更新用户的负债，当为该用户移除负债时出现问题。

似乎由于缺乏访问控制，
@GPOKD14689
 被利用，损失了 150 个 bnb
